@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@
+// Authoritative Server-Side Enforcement via Admin Firestore:
+// - Resolves users/{uid}, employees/{uid}, businesses/{businessId}/employees/{uid}, or query by firebase_uid/uid/email.
+// - Verifies ACTIVE status & multi-tenant business_id isolation.
+// - Rejects client spoofing via claimedRole (ROLE_SPOOFING_DETECTED) and claimedProfile (OPERATIONAL_PROFILE_SPOOFING_DETECTED).
+// - Rejects dual-field mismatch (CONFLICTING_OPERATIONAL_PROFILE_FIELDS) and user/employee profile divergence.
+// - Enforces capabilities:
+//   * "cash": TELLER roles require operational_profile === "teller"; EMPLOYEE & OVERSIGHT fail closed.
+//   * "transfer_initiate": Excludes JUNIOR_TELLER/EMPLOYEE/OVERSIGHT; TELLER requires "teller".
+//   * "transfer_approve": Strictly enforces canApproveInternalTransferRole(resolvedRole) -> MASTER_HEAD_TELLER fails closed with HTTP 403 FORBIDDEN_ROLE.
+//   * "till_supervise": Enforces canSuperviseTillLifecycleRole(resolvedRole); TELLER supervisors require "teller".
+//   * "commercial_sales" / "commercial_services": Enforces EMPLOYEE+vendeur (sales only) / EMPLOYEE+polyvalent (sales+services).

